+  legacy `openai-codex` spelling and an Anthropic key starting `sk-ant-oat01-`
+  (Claude setup-token) do not build a provider. Anthropic Console keys still do.
+- Cron and announcement delivery (`deliver_announcement`) and one-shot sends
+  (`send_channel_message`) ask OpenVault leave-machine before sending, the same
+  ask as channel startup. A refusal is returned as the error.
+- English CLI strings say Crew Edge: `--help` about text, `config` and `update`
+  help, status, security-status and daemon titles, and seven other product-name
+  strings in `crates/zeroclaw-runtime/locales/en/cli.ftl`.
+- Gate cases added: 3 in `crates/zeroclaw-runtime/src/netie_gate.rs`, 2 in
+  `crates/zeroclaw-channels/src/netie_gate.rs`.
+
 ## Not done yet (stage 3)
 
